    <briefdescription>
<para>Visits predicates on one indexed field, returning realtime offsets. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>nullopt means no pruning; an empty bitmap means no candidates. False negatives are not allowed. Unsupported predicates default to no pruning. Plugins override only the supported visits. </para>
